description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & 30% DEF/RES Pierce to Holy Abilities. and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv. 0/3 En-Holy;
WS Blue: Grants [Attach Holy 2 with Stacking] to user
WS Gold: Grants [Soul Break Gauge + 500] to user

